# ChangeMesh — Safe Local Configuration Template
#
# DO NOT commit real credentials or secrets to version control.
# DO NOT copy service-account JSON key files or hardcode live tokens.
#
# LOCAL AUTHENTICATION POLICY:
# ChangeMesh prefers Google Cloud Application Default Credentials (ADC)
# for local development:
#   gcloud auth application-default login
# Production deployments use Cloud Run Workload Identity / Managed Identity.
# Long-lived service account key files (.json) are prohibited and ignored.
#
# Usage:
#   Copy this file to .env for local development:
#   cp .env.example .env
#   (.env is strictly ignored by .gitignore)

# =============================================================================
# Google Cloud & Vertex AI (Non-Secret)
# Owner: P-02/P-28
# =============================================================================
# Google Cloud project ID (requiredness TBD by P-28)
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=

# Google Cloud deployment / Vertex AI region (requiredness TBD by P-28)
# Examples: global (Vertex AI Gemini), europe-west3 (Cloud Run / Firestore)
GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=

# =============================================================================
# Gemini Model Configuration (Non-Secret)
# Owner: P-08
# =============================================================================
# Exact Gemini model identifier (requiredness TBD by P-08)
# Example: gemini-3.6-flash
GEMINI_MODEL=

# =============================================================================
# GitHub Integration (Secret)
# Owner: P-19
# =============================================================================
# Personal access token / GitHub App token for optional live draft-PR creation.
# SECRET: MUST remain empty in this template. Never commit real tokens.
# Requiredness TBD by P-19.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# =============================================================================
# Demo Target Repository (Non-Secret)
# Owner: P-24
# =============================================================================
# Synthetic / demo repository path for ChangeMesh evaluation.
# Example: owner/changemesh-demo-enterprise
# Requiredness TBD by P-24.
DEMO_REPO=
